{"pageid":1681,"title":"Acidlands","displaytitle":"Acidlands","revid":21365,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 290px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/71/New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png/revision/latest?cb=20250202203258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"New Acidlands screenshot.1.png\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"290\" height=\"155\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"New Acidlands screenshot.1.png.png\" data-image-key=\"New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/71/New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/290?cb=20250202203258\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/71/New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png/revision/latest?cb=20250202203258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"New Acidlands screenshot.1.png\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/71/New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/290?cb=20250202203258\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"290\" height=\"155\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"New Acidlands screenshot.1.png.png\" data-image-key=\"New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/71/New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/290?cb=20250202203258\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:New_Acidlands_screenshot.1.png.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>Description\n</p><p>The <b>Acidlands</b> is a secondary location on the Oaklands map, off the coast of <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay.</a> It is characterized by its green hues and its expansive acidic waters. It is accessible behind an explodable wall, requiring 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bombs</a> (or 1 TNT barrel) to break through.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The Acidlands has two entrances:</li></ul>\n<ol><li>The Finlay entrance is located between <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>.</li>\n<li>The Mike's Mines entrance is located to the right of the Mikes Mines Farlands entry and then downhill right again at the T intersection.</li></ol>\n<p>It is also possible to reach the Acidlands without spending explosives once the player has obtained a <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</a>.\n</p><p>The Acidlands are difficult to traverse using a car, so some tips for traversing the Acidlands are:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Some areas may be easier to traverse on foot, it may be useful to have a grabber to move ores back.</li>\n<li>Having more than one trailer is risky; one trailer may fall into a hole and pull the rest of your vehicle with it, or trailers could simply get stuck in holes.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Sellner_Explorer\" title=\"Sellner Explorer\">Sellner Explorer</a> is the most useful vehicle for this area, as it is relatively good at traversing narrow spaces, while having about as much cargo space as a single trailer.</li>\n<li>Don’t be afraid to take multiple trips to avoid losing all of your ores.</li></ul>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lumberwork\">Lumberwork</span></h2>\n<p>The Acidlands are the spawn locations for <a href=\"/wiki/Willow\" title=\"Willow\">Willow</a> trees and <a href=\"/wiki/Windswept_Pine\" title=\"Windswept Pine\">Windswept Pine</a> trees. Willow wood offers middling profits when sold at the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a>. However, their unique green coloration can be used in forest-like and mystical builds, as well as in making foliage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Flora_and_Fauna\">Flora and Fauna</span></h2>\n<p>Near the pedestal where the Uncertain Pickaxe can be obtained, there are several <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Flower\" title=\"Corpse Flower\">Corpse Flowers</a> on the ground. When pressed in a <a href=\"/wiki/Press_Machine\" title=\"Press Machine\">Press Machine</a>, it sells for $1,000 coins, making it a profitable flower for early game players. While there are no animals in the game, there are multiple references to <a href=\"/wiki/Goblins\" title=\"Goblins\">Greeb Goblins</a> made.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mining\">Mining</span></h2>\n<p>Two types of stone node spawns in this location - <a href=\"/wiki/Gravel\" title=\"Gravel\">Gravel</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Grimestone\" title=\"Grimestone\">Grimestone</a>, which spawns in large, green stalagmite-like structures. While not unique to this area or stone type, two rare ores that have a higher chance of spawning in this location are: \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Greeb\" title=\"Greeb\">Greeb</a> in Marble or Grimestone nodes.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Uranium\" title=\"Uranium\">Uranium</a> in Limestone or Grimestone nodes. Mainly spawns in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Smog\" title=\"Acid Smog\">Acid Smog</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Limestone\" title=\"Limestone\">Limestone</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lightslate\" title=\"Lightslate\">Lightslate</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Grimestone\" title=\"Grimestone\">Grimestone</a> and more nodes.</li></ul>\n<p>Note that other more common ores, like <a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">Iron</a>, can still spawn in Grimestone as well. Due to the large average size of Grimestone pieces, players can retrieve the largest possible size of Uranium at the Acidlands.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Secret_Quests\">Secret Quests</span></h2>\n<p>The Acidlands also contains the main Pedestal for both the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Key\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Key\">Adurite Key</a> quests. The entrance to the pedestal is slightly obfuscated - it is accessible by walking/driving across a stone bridge similar to the stone spires.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"9e19979fbd320f59e94fb4827f8b490e\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Acid_Wastes_Pedestal_Disguised_Bridge-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:135px; width:185px; top:25px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Acid_Wastes_Pedestal_Disguised_Bridge.png\" title=\"Acid Wastes Pedestal Disguised Bridge.png (466 KB)\" style=\"height:135px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0f/Acid_Wastes_Pedestal_Disguised_Bridge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230825234956\" title=\"Acid Wastes Pedestal Disguised Bridge.png (466 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Stone bridge that leads to the spire/location of the main pedestal.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Acid Wastes Pedestal Disguised Bridge.png\" data-image-key=\"Acid_Wastes_Pedestal_Disguised_Bridge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Ston